# Prowem core

Read [docs/agents.md](docs/agents.md) before non-trivial work, then architecture / i18n / content / components / phases as needed. Prefer `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` over training data.

Agent rules for Cursor and Claude must stay in lockstep. If you change this file or any `.mdc`, update `CLAUDE.md` and `docs/agents.md` / `AGENTS.md` in the same turn when the meaning changed.

This is Next.js 16. Use `src/proxy.ts`, not `middleware.ts`. No `next-intl`. Root `<html>` lives in `src/app/[lang]/layout.tsx`.

Phase 1: no Prowem marketing sections, brand fonts, unused placeholders, or dark mode unless asked.

Never hardcode user-facing copy. Use dictionary props. Theme and header values come from `getSettings()`, not hex in components. Use token classes (`rounded-md`, `border-md`, `border-border`), not `rounded-[…]`. Mobile-first (`xs:` `sm:` `md:` `lg:` `xl:`). Use logical CSS (`ms-`, `pe-`, `text-start`), not `left` / `right`. SVG icons live in `src/components/icons/`, not in `ui/` or `templates/`.
